      "name": "[Blueprint][Yuzuha] Shaman's Charm - Lv. 60",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Yuzuha's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Purchase them from Boojee's Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: When the Etheric Phantom: Sobek effect ends, each squad member recovers HP equal to 10% of their remaining Shield from that effect.\nWhen Yuzuha uses her <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, her <color=#2BAD00>Anomaly Mastery increases by 40</color> for 30s. Repeated triggers reset the duration. When either attack hits an enemy, it reduces the target's <color=#2BAD00>DEF by 18%</color> and <color=#2BAD00>All-Attribute RES by 15%</color> for 30s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
